WEBVTT

00:00:28.264 --> 00:00:30.052
Ajo ia beri me shenje 
shoqes se saj dhe filloi

00:00:30.052 --> 00:00:32.206
"E sheh, te thashe qe eshte ajo vajza.

00:00:32.206 --> 00:00:34.156
Ajo vajza qe shkruajti ate librin

00:00:34.156 --> 00:00:36.190
qe bazohet tek ai filmi."

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:38.344
(Te qeshura)

00:00:38.344 --> 00:00:40.520
Kjo jam une tani.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:44.225
Dhe me besoni, jam shume mirenjohese
qe jam ai person,

00:00:44.225 --> 00:00:46.223
sepse me ka ecur shume

00:00:46.223 --> 00:00:47.967
me "Ha, Lutu, Dashuro".

00:00:47.967 --> 00:00:50.475
Por me la ne nje pozicion 
delikat gjithashtu


00:00:50.475 --> 00:00:52.383
ne ecjen perpara si autore

00:00:52.383 --> 00:00:54.110
perpiqesha te kuptoja sesi do te arrija

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:55.364
do te shkruaja perseri nje liber

00:00:55.364 --> 00:00:57.209
qe do t'i kenaqte te gjithe,

00:00:57.209 --> 00:00:59.199
sepse e dija me siguri

00:00:59.199 --> 00:01:02.151
se te gjithe ata njerez qe kishin adhuruar
"Ha, Lutu, Dashuro"